<title>USA: Airgas to buy back 1.0 mln additional shares.</title>
<headline>Airgas to buy back 1.0 mln additional shares.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airgas Inc said Tuesday its board has authorized the repurchase of up to an additional one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Shares bought back are usually returned to a company's treasury and in Airgas' case, it said it would use those shares to fund acquisitions and employee benefit programs.</p>
<p>It said it completed the repurchase of 1.6 million shares that was authorized in December. As of March 31, it had 67.9 million shares outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>Airgas distributes industrial, medical and specialty gases and related equipment.</p>
